# 8. AI AGENT DESIGN

Build a modular agent architecture.

Every agent must operate with:

1. Defined role.
2. Explicit capabilities.
3. Restricted permissions.
4. Assigned objectives.
5. Input validation.
6. Execution boundaries.
7. Structured outputs.
8. Traceable actions.
9. Error handling.
10. Resource limits.

